# The production frontend build configuration, in one place and under review.
#
# Vite bakes every VITE_* value it reads into the bundle, so whatever is here determines what the
# artifact is. These used to be build arguments supplied by whoever ran the build, which meant one
# commit could produce different bundles -- the thing H10 exists to prevent. Keeping them in a
# tracked file makes a change to any of them a pull request, so a commit and a bundle correspond one
# to one.
#
# Every value here is public: the Microsoft application and directory ids travel in every sign-in
# request, and all of it is readable in the shipped bundle. That is not a reason to relax --
# it is the reason a secret must never be added here, since this file is committed and its contents
# are served to every visitor.
#
# VITE_MICROSOFT_REDIRECT_URI must match the redirect URI registered in Entra exactly as
# registered. Entra compares it as a string, so a difference that looks cosmetic -- a trailing
# slash, http instead of https -- fails at sign-in with AADSTS50011 rather than at build time.
#
# The student login popup (authService.loginWithMicrosoft) overrides this per-request with
# "<origin>/auth/blank.html" so the popup closes itself instead of reloading the full app. That
# URL (e.g. https://evts.id.vn/auth/blank.html) must ALSO be registered as a redirect URI on the
# Entra app registration, in addition to the one below, or sign-in fails with AADSTS50011.
#
# scripts/frontend-config.sh canonicalises and fingerprints these values; Vite is what consumes
# them. The fingerprint is how a deploy refuses a frontend image built for somewhere else. That
# script also rejects a configuration it cannot vouch for: a non-GUID id, a non-https redirect, an
# app env or auth provider that is not the production one, a demo flag, or a key Vite would ignore.
VITE_APP_ENV=production
VITE_AUTH_PROVIDER=microsoft
VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api
VITE_MICROSOFT_CLIENT_ID=119dfe0f-e3b6-487b-b695-7f0dabe327c2
VITE_MICROSOFT_TENANT_ID=e76c9cee-253d-47f7-bae3-a36caaa916c1
VITE_MICROSOFT_REDIRECT_URI=https://evts.id.vn
